    <briefdescription>
<para>Reports that the device&apos;s radio has received a periodic advertisement in a subevent of an active PAwR train. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This event reports also empty advertisements, i.e., advertisements that contained no payload data. In this case the <computeroutput>data</computeroutput> parameter has zero length. </para>
